{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/sft0x0jtv1kp4aiae6ecf118p492wfp.mp3","text":"博士请放心，有我在您就是安全的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/i2hshistobwsddptg1ewbjvrhwykylw.mp3","text":"博士请放心，有我在您就是安全的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/9fy5r85d620px167xipezo5rz7kxcv7.mp3","text":"最近来了很多新人。然而新面孔越多，您越要多加注意。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/86/a3mcczec9uj1a0lih8jpimjfwy7m2rc.mp3","text":"无论发生什么情况，请别忘了紧急通讯频段，我会立刻前来处理。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/tgenecadq6v3m2dwvfgpgxq5tf0tt91.mp3","text":"我说话冷冰冰的？毕竟是在工作中嘛。若在休息时间，我也不会那么正经的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/16/k2s8is9v5g4i9vhe426zxhniw8elemu.mp3","text":"最近来了很多新人。然而新面孔越多，您越要多加注意。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/08/ce181b8n1535br079brje6swyd8ttm2.mp3","text":"无论发生什么情况，请别忘了紧急通讯频段，我会立刻前来处理。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/jxvo308ehxepocm7sux9tr7jkf6kff4.mp3","text":"我说话冷冰冰的？毕竟是在工作中嘛。若在休息时间，我也不会那么正经的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/4fxsostgi94m92z9ohfiqhk72jmmtb9.mp3","text":"罗德岛需要的不只是战斗干员。后勤、教育、事务交涉，无论哪个领域，都需要有专业人员支撑。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/reqmz05ymv66dawppb347t58a9mtl75.mp3","text":"以往要我出动必是恶战，而现在每场战斗都是恶战。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/svr96gxek3vaw1xz25n2bbrj3evxpld.mp3","text":"罗德岛需要的不只是战斗干员。后勤、教育、事务交涉，无论哪个领域，都需要有专业人员支撑。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/17/71zr0my9s0qtql2plrs1ueh0pmr05d0.mp3","text":"以往要我出动必是恶战，而现在每场战斗都是恶战。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/neh1vldsl72mnprndle3yu7c2r7i4e1.mp3","text":"这面盾叫做“般若”，是我从故乡带来的，它的“父亲”和家父是旧识。我在近卫局上任时，长官没少给我们白眼，但我和它都证明了自己——盾可以是武器，我也可以是。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/a2gdaqqe7l68oibm4pmw6a6jj2z1ty7.mp3","text":"这面“般若”沾上了龙门各个帮派的血。本以为会有很多人记恨我，不知道怎么回事，原本蔑视我的人都变得对我毕恭毕敬了。可能是个子大的原因，对吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/0ythcy2uk2eh7yg4c2affi9x5xs1ipi.mp3","text":"呼，我再来倒一杯吧。什么？你怎么就不行了？别担心，就算你醉倒在地我也能把你送回房间的......更不安心了？哎呀，说话好歹要看看气氛哪。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/41/t945glbru7vzq89y3pqxfkdhzua7v3t.mp3","text":"这面盾叫做“般若”，是我从故乡带来的，它的“父亲”和家父是旧识。我在近卫局上任时，长官没少给我们白眼，但我和它都证明了自己——盾可以是武器，我也可以是。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/35/k0hqp423nh4fmrtns8ncyfldt4zib2q.mp3","text":"这面“般若”沾上了龙门各个帮派的血。本以为会有很多人记恨我，不知道怎么回事，原本蔑视我的人都变得对我毕恭毕敬了。可能是个子大的原因，对吧？","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/mszessk6gfe1ypslujtdpgbospvp279.mp3","text":"呼，我再来倒一杯吧。什么？你怎么就不行了？别担心，就算你醉倒在地我也能把你送回房间的......更不安心了？哎呀，说话好歹要看看气氛哪。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/cvo6dv2y2reeqtwesx0tgtivm4r4joc.mp3","text":"嗯？没什么，我就是在这里守着你而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/6q3xaki33uhywgem6ekx1u7e12zjbst.mp3","text":"嗯？没什么，我就是在这里守着你而已。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/tsisyf1ntuhdoe3udtevpxzcisrs3kv.mp3","text":"星熊，重装干员，今后将是您的盾、您的利器、您的壁垒。请多多指教，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/jxn5380r12f2fjs264gbett99wr1so8.mp3","text":"星熊，重装干员，今后将是您的盾、您的利器、您的壁垒。请多多指教，博士。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/7evptiwl7s93frmx0kf0trhtqk3hw4q.mp3","text":"这都是博士您指导得好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/1x4gsy25vryp5xy752n51pjdygt1mwg.mp3","text":"这都是博士您指导得好。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/5ev6bqt9ofge7rzpgn0o3q2agh6typh.mp3","text":"我的荣幸。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/ilurb2g97i5eeev6dcmfmx8x82itk5m.mp3","text":"我的荣幸。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/6iqwta1p0aeet14ulmsl9g14p0euczb.mp3","text":"我要去哪里，没人能替我决定；但我做出决定，也没有人阻止得了。我准备好听从你的指挥了，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/s4uw72an3u9niqgk81i99l9eew52itf.mp3","text":"我要去哪里，没人能替我决定；但我做出决定，也没有人阻止得了。我准备好听从你的指挥了，博士。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/4j7mos0sia9vt1tf0lbyytqq96393n8.mp3","text":"我会保护大家。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/e303xlckz9edotcgtb72j65eukukgug.mp3","text":"我会保护大家。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/8w0rzci0t7frtup7p16o4mo1sljb3g7.mp3","text":"守护罗德岛也是我的责任。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/34/kd90lt6jxdqslnyl09cgcemk3rxi35w.mp3","text":"守护罗德岛也是我的责任。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/9gtnmhp0d3g1w7yzkq36suom36uupbi.mp3","text":"希望众人这次都能平安归来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/41/dvu2vj2fbbuua9k42g3pf7oec4a3sxp.mp3","text":"希望众人这次都能平安归来。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/f30npq4206r6rlt4mmzyfcn6x3phkwp.mp3","text":"既然有战斗的理由，就要有丧生的觉悟！","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/kyjcatkdg2oghvnsw8cmtzhgc2rczu2.mp3","text":"既然有战斗的理由，就要有丧生的觉悟！","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/idbh3rhdxwyx033ijntctg0y2pntk5s.mp3","text":"是，长官。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/48/8nmv53x5m454a8cg1oeh4407h9cgvrr.mp3","text":"了解。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/cov678vk3r9wgrpaq1sfycffkancjv7.mp3","text":"是，长官。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/3oi2y6n4udegqoxe2g2e0ghr89as869.mp3","text":"了解。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/oyi95gtqgd3186na3t5feihgksg5vpg.mp3","text":"一步也不会退后。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/23/9fiyamlvb6qbvrlr1enh6w6ytsphpp9.mp3","text":"一个都别想过去。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/d5lzp9rurklaqqawpp16nge7z20huno.mp3","text":"一步也不会退后。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/93pn455xzxejq8y2imlx8esu80sbckp.mp3","text":"一个都别想过去。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/pr86a0s8gu2um507l8dtxet8nliv8an.mp3","text":"般若会将你碾碎。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/65gt8j62twn67ob5kgwnkqwf7xasff2.mp3","text":"想伤害我的朋友，先问问这面盾答不答应！","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/7ujgeamebwz364mk5n0g6piyoxf9tlo.mp3","text":"百闻不如一见。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/mbonyh9r4lngxui1tm5xuqyp2ghv0mx.mp3","text":"般若啊，把你父亲铸造你时掺杂的怒火，全都喷发出来吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/o96uymehdfni1hy40rmgclv8h7flmoa.mp3","text":"般若会将你碾碎。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/rwuay1zhwkf2xsuh1ajmctgymum2x6f.mp3","text":"想伤害我的朋友，先问问这面盾答不答应！","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/5tq80p0rxdvj826rjsqj0fjw4na5d1u.mp3","text":"百闻不如一见。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/rwhcd4jetcu0y6vrojiwri3hqckg2sg.mp3","text":"般若啊，把你父亲铸造你时掺杂的怒火，全都喷发出来吧！","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/bno1eqthj9q1jwdva2uwx79ajnnniwn.mp3","text":"登山者总会挑战更陡峭的山岩。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/hxvrwo81cfsvhivaalocgt87vtn2jz3.mp3","text":"登山者总会挑战更陡峭的山岩。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/iuwt1mkrmqwhmzv0mwv278b16o9ppw5.mp3","text":"在我面前伤害我的同伴，是我最不能容忍的事情！","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/31/2mbtt2swaxr6majypiv07kw43l0iqeq.mp3","text":"在我面前伤害我的同伴，是我最不能容忍的事情！","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/qyvzb8fryfl4jwdphhcj7lnvgp4i3nu.mp3","text":"受伤了吗，抱歉，我的失职。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/00/l08qzj77fvnyljmwf3h8i5kfc4q8kg1.mp3","text":"受伤了吗，抱歉，我的失职。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/b170pc7c8216dbjg4b2nnxjl8orh5b3.mp3","text":"快点撤退，我来殿后！","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/66/owycz4d2wq5v9pyb4yp45xkxaflgmps.mp3","text":"快点撤退，我来殿后！","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/lgzm35uclz729rjw6ryvr1r4q178ut7.mp3","text":"我个子大，要进这屋子可有些麻烦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/b6lhwm06w6173hwtolhux9ozrcyanci.mp3","text":"我个子大，要进这屋子可有些麻烦。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/awyp8e4uzqqz3knzxxmvu4kqm8um57n.mp3","text":"在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/g42yxxadwvpiacghp712tja23mfscxc.mp3","text":"在。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/8lxyqwfo0smsetwulwqufafdic9f0lx.mp3","text":"博士，现在不是工作时间了，休息的时候就该好好放松吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/5zc5cnw69w6aqrs3xfxhm7pe71633c4.mp3","text":"博士，现在不是工作时间了，休息的时候就该好好放松吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/isfnfgwxu0vhnhppym55t7nmd39a7vt.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/pive7d4aad6u8fe2f4qnb5xhtw4hpyg.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/g7aopri31ee66mi2iya7mtebikbenm1.mp3","text":"新年快乐啊博士。难得你我都没有公务缠身的日子，要不要出去放松一下？要坐我的车去兜风吗，还是找个地方喝一顿？听你的。哈哈，可不能都选啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/ljdg6ww2q1aip0lhuwfz8aq6u3de6ni.mp3","text":"新年快乐啊博士。难得你我都没有公务缠身的日子，要不要出去放松一下？要坐我的车去兜风吗，还是找个地方喝一顿？听你的。哈哈，可不能都选啊。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/p1f6xjpqicymko1zwek97yay2rooru2.mp3","text":"哟，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_136_hsguma/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/dm8f10nos7j7oc04h22v59596v1xa52.mp3","text":"哟，博士。","alt":"voice_custom/char_136_hsguma_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/almz8x1fzssiamhvvkscfe1opujhfvh.mp3","text":"博士请放心，有我在您就是安全的。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/l5nn2qhk4v6rye6v3yip2amkdh78a4h.mp3","text":"最近来了很多新人。然而新面孔越多，您越要多加注意。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/25/gr2c82wm1d1hdie16wc16dkmhhua2zb.mp3","text":"无论发生什么情况，请别忘了紧急通讯频段，我会立刻前来处理。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/66/ddayxkf370lme55ksoxkxv9lkuw5i7h.mp3","text":"我说话冷冰冰的？毕竟是在工作中嘛。若在休息时间，我也不会那么正经的。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/348ozi0jgq9deiwdljabnc5f96jymd2.mp3","text":"罗德岛需要的不只是战斗干员。后勤、教育、事务交涉，无论哪个领域，都需要有专业人员支撑。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/b7v0qqml60kexnst3334sus3bupgct8.mp3","text":"以往要我出动必是恶战，而现在每场战斗都是恶战。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/0tci00uwzghpzj4xfpmjo5e8l7bea62.mp3","text":"这面盾叫做“般若”，是我从故乡带来的，它的“父亲”和家父是旧识。我在近卫局上任时，长官没少给我们白眼，但我和它都证明了自己——盾可以是武器，我也可以是。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/4qrl6hvunckfklrzkthk3epqf49ge98.mp3","text":"这面“般若”沾上了龙门各个帮派的血。本以为会有很多人记恨我，不知道怎么回事，原本蔑视我的人都变得对我毕恭毕敬了。可能是个子大的原因，对吧？","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/7vpqus23dg2h0gui69aywf2nzgqhn59.mp3","text":"呼，我再来倒一杯吧。什么？你怎么就不行了？别担心，就算你醉倒在地我也能把你送回房间的......更不安心了？哎呀，说话好歹要看看气氛哪。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/b6qjnat7c0qogombg8xip7elj10sv8h.mp3","text":"嗯？没什么，我就是在这里守着你而已。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/bix69h99k00r79star4dlrxg9ar3nor.mp3","text":"星熊，重装干员，今后将是您的盾、您的利器、您的壁垒。请多多指教，博士。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/8p3ktz6ggyije0d00121bv20c2s1rks.mp3","text":"这都是博士您指导得好。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/sx81mscmld1egkcsmuxscbfkq1rw1cv.mp3","text":"我的荣幸。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:1/19/0whz0go6uu43ydu38ugu3sh3mrowl65.mp3","text":"我要去哪里，没人能替我决定；但我做出决定，也没有人阻止得了。我准备好听从你的指挥了，博士。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/673kpu7ly2r9mgg2sthjmru216ptg56.mp3","text":"我会保护大家。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/3q1bdn78jvx264o0rf6s28z8jc7ji74.mp3","text":"守护罗德岛也是我的责任。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/igpb95j6o7jqkhshob4bcr3wu3ujii0.mp3","text":"希望众人这次都能平安归来。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/nerv74aqnx0ghh7t7fq3imyr1oqwi1u.mp3","text":"既然有战斗的理由，就要有丧生的觉悟！","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/m3tmuoomagnjug7f2qxejpk3lqtx920.mp3","text":"是，长官。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/bfi6i500zto6fbq0n8spiw0c1euuv8o.mp3","text":"了解。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/7yqn38g53nblyfeqnkgwaeoazhiq81d.mp3","text":"一步也不会退后。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/apwlk7l0x2kp44kuyf2xqsjhf2hp4rq.mp3","text":"一个都别想过去。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/jes8bt74hcl0zpssw3w3u2y9152p9g2.mp3","text":"般若会将你碾碎。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/95/7hspv7lmshd6pirty6ta2q4f7imcpe9.mp3","text":"想伤害我的朋友，先问问这面盾答不答应！","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/g5eeo7ufbymmx55zofdeu0zfzf8idwq.mp3","text":"百闻不如一见。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/k6tg5va8eb39id7kwod3p4p67faho3a.mp3","text":"般若啊，把你父亲铸造你时掺杂的怒火，全都喷发出来吧！","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/08wjlahnduqd627eebh0vcxiz36kv9c.mp3","text":"登山者总会挑战更陡峭的山岩。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/8a0ljv5g1c8a3qjkkey0dpjl8k4ugut.mp3","text":"在我面前伤害我的同伴，是我最不能容忍的事情！","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/ax3gtxbrah8mxx8tes2uupfswjfrq25.mp3","text":"受伤了吗，抱歉，我的失职。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/hz4v1szilrlqzpel38lds3p334xpc2f.mp3","text":"快点撤退，我来殿后！","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/782gbd7b7edzgw0ldfan3km3y8wrvh6.mp3","text":"我个子大，要进这屋子可有些麻烦。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/jgcid58ex4x6q85ht2w31nsd42cjr58.mp3","text":"在。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/dce1y72pnyrn8psxsfcczduh4o3qxsa.mp3","text":"博士，现在不是工作时间了，休息的时候就该好好放松吧。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/6z98l9ug1dp5eqx9uhki42im8wtsxs9.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/de51dg4nw0k1yzljl0huimc6paztlod.mp3","text":"新年快乐啊博士。难得你我都没有公务缠身的日子，要不要出去放松一下？要坐我的车去兜风吗，还是找个地方喝一顿？听你的。哈哈，可不能都选啊。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/hwz3r4hbwr7bcwnqd2pzf4n6z1e7ebv.mp3","text":"哟，博士。","alt":"voice/char_136_hsguma/cn_042.mp3"}]}}